From ada498d6d1559764f1d1182b34cd0b4edcbb2d8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:02:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: add OnePlus 8 Pro telephoto
 camera

- add the telephoto camera (Samsung S5K3M5 on CSIPHY2) to the
  instantnoodlep device tree and enable CONFIG_VIDEO_S5K3M5=m
- fix the selection rectangles of the s5k3m5 driver, which reported a
  4208x4208 pixel array and no default crop to libcamera

Tested with libcamera (simple pipeline, software ISP): the camera is
listed as back camera with rotation 270 and streams at 60 fps; with the
S5K3M5 support in temp/libcamera the AGC reaches a normal exposure.
Autofocus (the actuator has no driver yet) and the other four cameras
are not supported.

